      "note": "A training-free residual-stream steering method that mitigates overthinking by projecting a difference-in-means 'overthinking direction' onto a low-dimensional PCA manifold of the model's activations before ablating it, removing the accuracy-degrading interference noise that limits naive single-direction steering.",
      "title": "Mitigating Overthinking in Large Reasoning Models via Manifold Steering"
    },
